@startuml LicenseOfflineSequence
title Licensing - Offline License Files (air-gapped and egress-blocked CI, since 1.10)

actor "Operator" as Op
participant "IssueOfflineLicense\n(tools/, operator machine)" as Tool
participant "Signing keypair\n~/.config/deversity/\noffline-license-signing/" as Keys
actor "Customer" as Cust
participant "Concurrency\nRunner" as Runner
participant "License\nGuard" as Guard
participant "Offline\nLicense" as Off

== Issuance - operator machine, once per customer, no provider account ==

Op -> Tool : issue --licensee "Acme Corp AB"\n--email licence@acme-corp.com\n--binding domain --expires 2027-08-11
Tool -> Tool : payload = Properties text\n(product, licensee, email,\nbinding, issued, expires)
Tool -> Keys : Ed25519 sign(payload bytes)\nwith private.pem
Keys --> Tool : signature
Tool --> Op : one line:\nATL1.<b64url payload>.<b64url signature>
Op -> Tool : verify --pub public.pem --file ...\n(re-runs the library's checks)
Op -> Cust : send the .atl-license file\n(renewal = a replacement file)

== Validation - every JVM, inside the customer's build, no network ==

Runner -> Guard : check(config)\nwith -Dlicense.file=<path>
activate Guard
note over Guard
  A present file is a commercial assertion:
  CI auto-mock is disabled by it. Only the
  explicit -Dlicense.mock.mode=true outranks it.
  The file never falls back to online validation.
end note
Guard -> Off : verify(path, license.user.email)
activate Off
Off -> Off : read file, split ATL1.<payload>.<sig>
Off -> Off : Ed25519 verify against the vendor\npublic key embedded in the library
Off -> Off : product == async-test-lib?
Off -> Off : expires >= today (UTC)?
Off -> Off : email binding:\ndomain - every address on the licensed domain\nexact - the one licensed address\nnone - negotiated site licence\n(ASCII-only case fold, no Unicode tricks)

alt every check passes
  Off --> Guard : Grant(licensee, expires)
  Guard --> Runner : LICENSE GRANTED: OFFLINE_LICENSE\n(once per JVM)
else any anomaly
  Off --> Guard : SecurityException, named reason:\nOFFLINE_FILE_MALFORMED (truncated in transit)\nOFFLINE_FILE_SIGNATURE_INVALID (altered / not ours)\nOFFLINE_FILE_WRONG_PRODUCT\nOFFLINE_LICENSE_EXPIRED (renewal due)\nOFFLINE_LICENSE_SCOPE_MISMATCH (wrong address/domain)
  Guard --> Runner : build fails closed
end
deactivate Off
deactivate Guard

note over Keys
  The private key exists only on the operator
  machine. Rotating it invalidates every file
  already issued against released library
  versions, so the keygen mode refuses to
  overwrite an existing private.pem.
end note
@enduml
